window.products.push({"id":777143,"name":"KARACA Layla Turkish Tea Pot Set, 1 Lt 2.2 lb Teapot & 1.75 Lt 3.85 lb Kettle, 18/10 Stainless Steel, Tea Sieve, Turkish Tea Maker, Double Teapots, Du","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IcJAi3FTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Breakfast, lunch, fun occasions or after-dinner time are unthinkable without tea.  The Karaca Layla teapot set is a traditional metal tea set that includes a tea strainer. Made of stainless steel, the set is perfect for families of 4 to 6 people with its 1-litre teapot and 1.75-litre kettle and can be used on induction cookers. What's more, its metallic color makes it extremely stylish and attractive. How to prepare Turkish Tea? Preparation time: 30 minutes Ingredients: 1 lt water 1 lt water 3 tbsp black tea 3 tbsp black tea Instructions: In the bottom teapot, boil the water. Then put the black tea to the top pot and transfer 1/3 of boiled water from the lower pot to the top pot. Let the tea brew in the top pot, as the water keeps boiling at slow heat for about 20 minutes. When serving Turkish tea, pour 1/3 of a glass with tea and fill the rest with boiled water. You can serve it with sugar according to your taste. Excellent gift - With its unparalleled beauty and aesthetics that will last for years, it makes a great gift for new households and families as the simple yet elegant design allows for versatility of use and caters for all tastes. Excellent gift - With its unparalleled beauty and aesthetics that will last for years, it makes a great gift for new households and families as the simple yet elegant design allows for versatility of use and caters for all tastes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IcJAi3FTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KARACA","source_asin":"B08NSDQZ6G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-777143","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NSDQZ6G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NSDQZ6G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
