window.products.push({"id":777146,"name":"Bluepillows Replacement Accessory for Irobot Roomba 595 600 610 620 630 640 645 650 655 660 Replenishment Kit 10Pcs 600 Series High-efficient Replacem","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PTJuQ0bHL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Description: ❤Hepa Filters made of high quality PC, fully use of efficient filter environmental protection plastic material ❤Side Brushes allows your Roomba to reach deeper into the carpet, compatible for irobot vacuum cleaner ❤To keep your iRobot Roomba operating at peak performance, filters, rollers and side brushes should be replaced every 2 - 3 months How to clean the Side Brushes: ✿1.Use the corner small screwdriver to remove the screws ✿2.Remove the brush, remove the hair or debris,and put the side brushes back in place. How to clean the Filters: ✿1.Now press and lift the filtered or release tab ✿2.Remove the filter by grasping the yellow tab ✿3.Clean room was filter by tapping against your trash container ✿4.To reinstall the filter, press the metal filter lever,with the side of filter and push the filter down, the filter door will not close if the filter is not installed correctly How to clean the Extractors: ✿1. Pinch the yellow extractor frame release tabs, lift up the extractor frame and remove any obstructions. ✿2. Remove the extractors and remove the yellow extractor caps. Remove any hair or debris that has collected underneath the caps and around the metal axles. ✿3. Remove hair and debris from the square and hex plastic pegs on the other side of the extractors. Package Content: Each package of these roomba parts includes one set of 10: 3 x filters; 3 x 3-armed side brush; 1 x bristle brush; 1 x flexible beater brush; 2 x cleaning tools.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PTJuQ0bHL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bluepillows","source_asin":"B072BLYKYG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-777146","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072BLYKYG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072BLYKYG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
