window.products.push({"id":777250,"name":"LELE LIFE 8pcs 360° Rotating Ring Curtain Rod Brackets No Drilling, Unlimited Installation Angle, Self Adhesive Tension Rod Curtain Rod Holders, Curta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41E4vgaqp+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"If you have a small bathroom or kitchen and want to use the corner triangle area to hang things, you can choose our curtain ring bracket with unlimited installation angles to help you save more space. PRODUCT FEATURES ●Unique design: The hanging hole on the curtain hangers can be rotated, and the pole can be installed without picking an angle, which is very suitable for the triangle area of the bathroom, and can be used to install the towel road, saving space. ●Good stickiness: The spring tension rod bracket is made of high-quality ABS material, which is wear-resistant and durable. Good stickiness and not easy to fall off. There is no need to drill holes during installation, and the installation is simple. ●Installation surface: They are suitable for installation on smooth and dry surfaces such as tiles, glass, wood cabinets, metal, etc., not suitable for installation on painted or textured walls. ●Multi-purpose: White tension rod brackets are suitable for bathroom towel rods, curtain rods, closet rods, etc., used to store toiletries, kitchen utensils, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41E4vgaqp+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LELE LIFE","source_asin":"B0B1WZVFTD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-777250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1WZVFTD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1WZVFTD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":777251,"name":"Sandicast Red Pembroke Welsh Corgi with Stocking Christmas Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.1,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81W7FmC68jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pets are such an important part of our lives and our families. And, when Christmas rolls around, they love the festivities just as much as we do. Sandicast's charming collection of christmas ornaments features over 40 different breeds of man's best friend enjoying the holiday spirit in a variety of ways: some sport bright red santa hats or are cozily wrapped in winter scarves, others are decked out in strings of lights or carrying christmas stockings. Several breeds are also available in multiple expressions and poses (sitting, standing, lying, sitting pretty or crouching), each one \"decorated\" for holidays in a different way. Sandicast christmas ornaments have a securely attached metallic cord loop for hanging and are packaged in a protective reusable box that's perfect for year-round storage. Don't feel like putting that special ornament away just because the holidays are over. Go ahead, enjoy it all year, we won't tell. Sandicast was founded in 1981 when artist Sandra Brue realized her dream of combining her artistic talent and her lifelong love of animals. Because of the superb quality of her work, collectors around the world now pursue the demand for Sandicast animal sculptures. Queen Elizabeth and president Clinton are just a few of the many celebrities that have Sandicast animals. Sandra has sculpted more than 400 animals; the Sandicast collection includes everything from dogs and cats to exotic wildlife. Each piece is hand-cast and hand-painted and virtually comes to life when sparkling glass eyes are inserted. Sandicast invites you to discover their extensive collection of hand sculpted animals available on amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81W7FmC68jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sandicast","source_asin":"B014KMC038","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-777251","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014KMC038","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014KMC038","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
