window.products.push({"id":777325,"name":"LifeSupplyUSA Filter Replacement Set fits Medify MA-Smart (3 in 1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91nxwrAUXdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BEST VALUE: Includes 1 HEPA filter, 1 carbon filter, and 1 pre-filter (3 in 1) of HEPA + filter Set, measures approximately 7.8in. x7.8in. x7.8in.. Filter made with high-quality components for better longevity, life expectancy of up to 6-months to 12-months. GREAT AIR QUALITY: High-Efficiency Particulate Air (HEPA) design will filter very fine particles. It targets airborne particles such as dust, lint, dirt, pet hair, dander, and more. Carbon prolongs the life of the HEPA and filters the largest particles and is also an odor remover. USED BY PROFESSIONALS: LifeSupplyUSA Air Purifier Filters are made to be durable & efficient for months. SIMPLE TO INSTALL: Installation is easy; no tools required. Simply remove and replace from your air purifier unit when needed. Replace this filter every 6 months.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91nxwrAUXdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LifeSupplyUSA","source_asin":"B08XZWR6X4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-777325","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XZWR6X4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XZWR6X4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
