window.products.push({"id":777328,"name":"Kitchen Towels, Set of 2, Exclusive Handmade Design, Highly Absorbent Designer Tea Towels, 12x20 inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41phgASjyML._AC_.jpg","description":"p@ss: Forget Your Passwords. Password peace of mind. Always handy, no batteries required. STOP REMEMBERING PASSWORDS! The p@ss key fob lets you generate hard to guess, unique passwords for each of your accounts.. and you won't have to remember any of them! Just 'dial in' using one simple rule, and you can recall every password on demand. If one of the websites or companies you use gets hacked, their passwords will be useless for any of your other accounts. Your email and banking accounts will be safe since you'll have a semi-random, unique password for every site you use, which have no clear relation to each other. The p@ss key chain fob is the low-tech, simple to use, always on-hand solution for making hard to guess -- but easy to recall -- passwords, for all your online web accounts and personal electronic devices. The p@ss is made of high-quality stainless steel with high-durability etched lettering. The hollow cylinder can also hold pills or important contact information: handy if you ever misplace it or your keys! FAQs Q: What if I lose my p@ss? A: Included with the unit is a note with the complete symbol set of your fob, to be placed in safe storage. If you lose your product you can refer to the note in an emergency. Also included is a contact form you should fill in with your information and leave rolled up inside the fob cylinder so someone can return your keys & fob to you should you ever lose them. Q: Won't other people with a p@ss create the same passwords if they use the same sites I do? A: This part is up to you: the 'dial in' rule. Included are a few example rules you can choose to 'dial in' your passwords based on the website, company or account, but use your imagination and you can come up with your own simple rule to use. You can also unscrew the chain and re-order the included rings however you like. Finally, every production run of the p@ss is made with a unique set of rings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41phgASjyML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitoo","source_asin":"B00TCT5JT2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-777328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00TCT5JT2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00TCT5JT2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
