window.products.push({"id":777373,"name":"DR.COMFY Knee Pillow Leg Pillow for Sleeping Hip Sciatica Leg Knees Joints Pain & Pregnancy Bed Leg Memory Foam Pillow for Side Sleepers with Adjustab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SF4efsYZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you insomnia due to sciatica or neuralgia? Does your foot / lower back/hip / joint / knee pain make you wake up at night? If so, our memory foam orthopedic under-leg pillow reduces the pressure on your back and hips It also helps to relieve the tension in the hamstrings and calves. This is the best leg pillow, high-density memory foam for pain relief, and its high-density foam core provides higher support and pain relief for many heavier competitors. Styrofoam neither sinks nor deforms. Who should use our leg pillow? Side sleepers: Many side sleepers will feel uncomfortable resting one leg on the other, and will rub and rub when their leg touch. Back sleepers: Many people find that sleeping with a pillow below their knees can relieve tension and stress. This can also lift the lower body, help adjust posture, and improve blood circulation to the legs. Therefore, the leg pillow is particularly beneficial for supine people with poor blood circulation. Pregnant women: For many pregnant women, putting a pillow on their legs to sleep will reduce the pressure on the hips and pelvis. The knee pillow can also help pregnant women who have spinal instability due to back problems. People with back or knee pain: Keeping legs aligned can reduce discomfort for people with back pain. Restless leg syndrome: The leg pillow provides additional stability and helps prevent the legs from moving too much. Size: 9.84*9.06*5.12” Weight: 13.5oz Color:Blue Material: Incore-memory foam, 100% slow rebound material. black color Cover: Air layer fabric. Machine Washable & Removable cover. Wash: Temperature ≤ 40℃, NO BLEACH, NO DRY, NO IRON, DRY CLEANABLE Package included: 1*Leg Memory Pillow WARMING: Memory foam is not washable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SF4efsYZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DR.COMFY","source_asin":"B09471LXJ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-777373","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09471LXJ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09471LXJ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
