window.products.push({"id":777405,"name":"J.A. Henckels Twin Pro S 8-Inch Chef's Knife with Hollow Edge","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/219W2FGKBSL._AC_.jpg","description":"One of the most-used knives in the kitchen, this sturdy, heavy 8-inch chef's knife offers a broad, strong blade and fine cutting edge for slicing, chopping, dicing, and mincing herbs, fruits, and vegetables. Its Friodur ice-hardened stainless-steel blade features a hollow edge that helps keep sliced food from sticking to the blade, which allows for extra-thin cutting. The knife's super bolster provides weight, ensures safety, and adds balance, while its tang construction adds additional balance and strength. Moreover, the knife's triple-riveted Novodur handle offers a molded design for a smooth, comfortable grip. Henckels recommends washing and drying the knife immediately after use. Made in Germany, the chef's knife measures approximately 13 by 1 by 2 inches and carries a limited lifetime warranty. From the Manufacturer The J.A. Henckels Twin Professional S (or Pro S) knife series features trustworthy quality and classic three-rivet styling--it’s a line of knives admired by both professional chefs and home cooks of all skill levels. The Twin Pro S line contains knives for all tasks, including the following open stock knife types: parer, bread, peeling, sandwich, utility, carving, steak, chef’s, Granton edge slicer, santoku, and others. Twin Pro S knives are also available in a range of block sets and gift sets, to be sure that your cutlery needs are covered. A Reliable Standard in Knife Construction Twin Pro S knives are precision forged from a single piece of exclusive-formula high-carbon, no-stain steel under the all-new Sigmaforge standard. As a result, Twin Pro S knives have improved quality consistency, lasting sharpness, and perfect geometry. Sigmaforge one-piece construction also provides high precision and improved stability of the blade and steel structure, thus improving cutting-edge retention for lasting sharpness. In addition, Twin Pro S knives use J.A. Henckels’s Friodur ice hardening for corrosion resistance, a process that also contributes to cutting-edge retention. An Ergonomic Handle for Easier Use J.A. Henckels’s Twin Pro S knives boast a comfortable, ergonomic three-rivet handle design that won’t wear against the hand and helps to provide control when doing any cutting task. These durable Novodur handles are perfectly bonded to the full tang on each knife for stability and durability. The impeccably balanced super bolster provides weight and adds balance for safer and more professional cutting. Features Sigmaforge one-piece precision-forged construction: Provides perfect geometry, high precision, and improved stability of the blade and steel structure, thus improving cutting-edge retention for lasting sharpness. Sigmaforge one-piece precision-forged construction: Provides perfect geometry, high precision, and improved stability of the blade and steel structure, thus improving cutting-edge retention for lasting sharpness. Laser-controlled edge: Is sharper and stays sharper longer. Has a more consistent blade angle. Laser-controlled edge: Is sharper and stays sharper longer. Has a more consistent blade angle. Friodur ice hardening: Maximum no-stain properties and more blade strength. Improved resistance to corrosion and pitting. Friodur ice hardening: Maximum no-stain properties and more blade strength. Improved resistance to corrosion and pitting. Super bolster: Provides weight, insures safety, and adds balance. Super bolster: Provides weight, insures safety, and adds balance. Full visible tang construction: Provides proper balance and greater strength. Full visible tang construction: Provides proper balance and greater strength. High-carbon, no-stain steel, an exclusive J.A. Henckels formula: Nonstaining, nonrusting. High-carbon, no-stain steel, an exclusive J.A. Henckels formula: Nonstaining, nonrusting. Precision honed: Is sharper and stays sharper longer. Precision honed: Is sharper and stays sharper longer. Triple-riveted Novodur handles: Durable, strong, and smooth, these comfortable handles are perfectly balanced. Triple-riveted Novodur handles: Durable, strong, and smooth, these comfortable handles are perfectly balanced. Dishwasher-safe: Easy care (though hand washing is recommended by J.A. Henckels). Dishwasher-safe: Easy care (though hand washing is recommended by J.A. Henckels). Full warranty: J.A. Henckels stands behind all its knives. Full warranty: J.A. Henckels stands behind all its knives.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/219W2FGKBSL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HENCKELS","source_asin":"B00068J25U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-777405","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00068J25U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00068J25U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
