window.products.push({"id":777551,"name":"Toothbrush Holder Wall Mounted for Bathroom, Automatic Toothpaste Dispenser Kit with Magnetic Cups Kids & Family Set Toothbrush Holders, Storage Rack ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618eeuJm1gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【MULTIFUNCTIONAL】Not only a toothbrush holder and toothpaste dispenser, but also a storage tray. The top of the toothbrush holder is divided into multiple compartments. You can put razors, combs, cosmetics, etc, in the toothbrush holder. In addition, a locker is designed for you to store other small objects such as lipstick, powder, etc, so as to save space for you and avoid messy bathroom.(NOTE:The 1 cup version has no drawers.If you want drawers, please choose the 2 cups or 3 cups version.) 【AUTOMATIC TOOTHBRUSH DISPENSER】We have designed a toothpaste dispenser with an automatic toothbrush holder wall mounted. You can put toothpaste into the toothpaste dispenser, and the dispenser will automatically dispense an appropriate amount of toothpaste for you to prevent waste. Use our Bellydot toothpaste dispenser can save you up to 30% toothpaste. 【UPSIDE-DOWN CUP DESIGN】The inverted cup design of the toothbrush holder can be used for dust prevention and drainage. The magnet at the bottom of the cup can be firmly fixed on the toothbrush storage to ensure that the inside of the cup is dry and prevent bacterial growth, making toothbrush cup safer and healthier to use. 【Easy to Install】No holes and no drill. Wall mounted installation does not hurt the wall.The tooth brush holder is attached with strong seamless stickers. Strong adhesive, toothbrush holder wall mounted. Please note that this sticker is only applicable to surfaces such as smooth tile, wooden wall, smooth marble, smooth glass, frosted glass, smooth metal. 【HIGH-QUALITY MATERIALS】The wall toothbrush holder is made of ABS material, non-toxic, tasteless and environmentally friendly. It has good high-temperature resistance, environmental protection, safety and sanitation. It is a toothbrush holder set worth using. If you have any quality problems, please contact us. You can get efficient after-sales consultation and service within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618eeuJm1gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bellydot","source_asin":"B09SDZVMBF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-777551","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SDZVMBF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SDZVMBF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
