window.products.push({"id":777656,"name":"3-Shelf Bathroom Organizer Over-The-Toilet Storage, Bathroom Shelf Over Toilet with Adjustable Shelves and Hooks, Stainless Steel Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+qL40DnrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Safe, Secure Storage】3 wide slatted shelves hold stored items flat on the shelves without tipping or rolling on their sides, providing plenty of room to store or display bathroom essentials. The entire space-saving unit can hold up to 33 pounds without bending or warping. 【Non-Slip Design for all Floors】Two non-slip snaps that do not require drilling securely hold the toilet organizer to the wall without shifting, sliding or damaging the wall. By adjusting the height of the four non-slip rubber bottoms, it can be stabilized on slightly uneven floors. Keeps you and your family safe while saving you all the floor space you need. 【Stainless Steel】 The over the toilet storage is made of stainless steel, which is rust and water resistant for years of use in wet bathrooms. It is the perfect storage rack for towels, toilet paper, shampoo, candles or any other bathroom essentials. 【15 Minutes Quick Assembly】The over toilet shelf can be quickly installed without tools, and the step-by-step instructions make assembly easy. Suitable for small and medium toilets. 【Don't Worry About Buying】Any BsBsBest brand products are covered by a three-year warranty. If you encounter any problems, please contact us and we will give you a satisfactory answer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+qL40DnrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BsBsBest","source_asin":"B09H723H3H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-777656","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H723H3H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H723H3H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":777657,"name":"Chic Stripe Texture Table Cloths Wrinkle Free Rectangle Tablecloth Jacquard Waterproof Modern Style Spill-Proof Washable Covers for Holiday Kitchen Of","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FlfwmoqwL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Material: Polyester Jacquard fabric, simple and luxurious diamond pattern design brings a noble and warm look without losing it’s functionality. The rectangle tablecloth has a good decorative effect and can be oil-proof, wrinkle free, washable. How to Choose: 52×70In(for seats of 4). 60×84In(for seats of 4-6). 60×104In(for seats of 6-8). 60×120In(for seats of 10-12). The perfect drop length is each length of 8~12IN(Table)/4~8IN(Tea Table). Referenced Formula: ①Tablecloth=You table length + perfect each pendulous length(8~12IN) ×2. ②Tea Tablecloth = Tea Table Length + each end drops(4~8IN)×2. Keep the length of the recommended pendulous length within this range will achieve best decoration and protection effect. Using table cloth creates a wonderful and luxurious setting for your family and friends to enjoy together. Perfect Table Decor: There are 3 style of tablecloth to choose from: Diamond, Plaid, Stripe. Diverse Jacquard Pattern Design meets your needs of daily use, activities, holiday, picnic, patio, wedding banquet, birthday party, family meals, festival: Christmas, Thanksgiving. Rectangle Table Cloth suits for restaurant, dinning table, family room, tea table, cafe, buffet, gardens. About Us: Lotmat Fashion Home inspired by Entry Lux, Chic, Modern Style, striving to provide satisfying textile products and serve. If there are any questions or needs, please feel free to contact with us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FlfwmoqwL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lotmat","source_asin":"B07XWWTGXQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-777657","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XWWTGXQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XWWTGXQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
