window.products.push({"id":777694,"name":"DESTALYA Lemon Squeezer, Citrus Juicer Hand, Crystal Reamer, Manual Extractor with Handle and Pour Spout for Fresh Fruit Juice Lime Orange, Heavyweigh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u3OhFJf9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Glass Lemon Squeezer: Gets the maximum amount of juices from oranges, lemons, limes and other citrus fruits. You will get fresh juice in seconds with its modern design and function. It is great for home or outdoor use, such as camping, picnics, trips etc. Citrus Juicer: The juicing reamer features ideal angles for optimal juicing output. It ensures you get the best original flavor for making lemonade, drinks and cocktails or baking lemon pie or cakes. Crystal Glass Design: Made from heavyweight glass to use for all citrus fruits. This lemon squeezer is designed with a handle and pour spout for easy use. Plus, the pour spout design and durable construction make this citrus squeezer an essential kitchen tool in your daily life. Dimensions and Care: 5.70 x 2.36 inches or 14.50 x 5.70 cm. Made in Turkey. It is easy to use and easy to store and dishwasher safe. You can also wash by hand to rinse the lemon juice, pulp and seeds. This healthy lemon juicer can be a gift or present for any special days. Package: Glass Ashtray Set is safely packed in a carton box with stretch wrap. Considering the long shipment process, if the product is broken once you received, please contact us for a replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u3OhFJf9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DESTALYA","source_asin":"B09BFFMQBF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-777694","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BFFMQBF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BFFMQBF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":777695,"name":"Finally 21-21st Birthday Party Decorations for Men - 6 Beer Bottle Label Stickers and 1 Carrier","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jmly33hLL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Looking for something unique and original for a 21 party? Our Finally 21 - 6 Beer Bottle Labels 21st Birthday with 1 Beer Carrier are the perfect gift for the birthday person or bring to a party. This set comes with a craft paper carrier and with 6 beer bottle labels that are printed on sticker paper that is waterproof. Apply labels to room temperature bottles. Apply beer bottle labels either after removing original label for best results or put over existing labels if you choose. Chill after you are done applying labels. For the two larger labels that are left over apply to the front and back of paper carrier. Use the two smaller ones to put on each end of the paper carrier to give you the completed look. (Beer in image is obviously NOT included).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jmly33hLL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Big Dot of Happiness","source_asin":"B017MDTBIE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-777695","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017MDTBIE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017MDTBIE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
