window.products.push({"id":777977,"name":"PRESSE by Bobble French Coffee Press And Insulated Stainless Steel Travel Tumbler for On-The-Go Brewing - 13 oz (Peacock)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EArYN5KfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rise and Brew! Skip the waste and get your caffeine fix in style with Presse by bobble. The 2-piece stainless steel coffee press brews delicious coffee in just 3 minutes. Gourmet coffee couldn't be simpler - just brew, press and go. Directions: Step 1 -BREW: Just add medium-coarse freshly ground coffee and hot water to the outer tumbler. Step 2-PRESS: Wait for 3 minutes, then push down on the inner press. Step 3-GO: Enjoy coffee right from the Presse. Coffee stays hot and delicious for hours.  Our unique micro-filter separates grounds from finished coffee and traps them at the bottom to stop brewing immediately when pressed. No bitterness and no grounds in your teeth. Our 3 layers of insulation means your coffee stays hot for your morning commute and into your day. The best part? The outside stays cool to the touch. Care & Maintenance of your Presse: Super easy to clean. No flimsy screen that gets clogged with coffee grounds, no worries about breaking the glass part of your press. Presse is dishwasher safe. About bobble: Founded in 2010, we set out to satisfy our desire for fresh, tasty and portable water while keeping our wallets and planet happy. Disposable water won’t do that, so we decided to reinvent the water bottle. No problem! We needed our bottle to be reusable and resilient. We refused to sacrifice style in favor of function. We wanted water that tasted better. We wanted it all, and we wanted it now. And so, bobble was born. Since then the bobble family has expanded to bring you coffee, tea, and at-home products - all created with the idea that taste will always triumph over waste. At bobble, our mission is threefold. 1 – to bring style to everyday life, 2- to encourage health and fitness and 3) sustainability – we provide sleek, easy and impactful drinking solutions that help reduce single serve waste.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EArYN5KfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bobble","source_asin":"B083YM8L46","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-777977","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083YM8L46","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083YM8L46","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
